          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.10.1+2CH.10.2+2CH.10.3+2CH.10.4+2CH.10.5+2CH.10.6+2CH.10.7+2CH.10.8+2CH.10.9+2CH.10.10+2CH.10.11+2CH.10.12+2CH.10.13+2CH.10.14+2CH.10.15+2CH.10.16+2CH.10.17+2CH.10.18+2CH.10.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Chron 10.1-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Rehoboam went to Shechem, for all Israel had come to Shechem to make him king. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Jeroboam the son of Nebat heard of it (for he was still in Egypt, whither he had fled from King Solomon), then Jeroboam returned from",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg Compare 2 Chron 10.2: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "dwelt in",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they sent and called him; and Jeroboam and all the assembly of Israel came and said to Rehoboam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Your father made our yoke heavy. Now therefore lighten the hard service of your father and his heavy yoke upon us, and we will serve you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to them, “Depart for three days, then come again to me.” So the people went away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Rehoboam took counsel with the old men, who had stood before Solomon his father while he was yet alive, saying, “How do you advise me to answer this people?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said to him, “If you will be a servant to this people today and serve them, and speak good words to them when you answer them, then they will be your servants for ever.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he forsook the counsel which the old men gave him, and took counsel with the young men who had grown up with him and stood before him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to them, “What do you advise that we answer this people who have said to me, ‘Lighten the yoke that your father put upon us’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the young men who had grown up with him said to him, “Thus shall you speak to this people who said to you, ‘Your father made our yoke heavy, but do you lighten it for us’; thus shall you say to them, ‘My little finger is thicker than my father's loins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, whereas my father laid upon you a heavy yoke, I will add to your yoke. My father chastised you with whips, but I will chastise you with scorpions.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jeroboam and all the people came to Rehoboam the third day, as the king said, “Come to me again the third day.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king answered the people harshly, and forsaking the counsel which the old men had given him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he spoke to them according to the counsel of the young men, saying, “My father made your yoke heavy, but I will add to your yoke; my father chastised you with whips, but I will chastise you with scorpions.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the king did not hearken to the people; for it was a turn of affairs brought about by the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " that he might fulfil his word, which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke by Ahijah the Shilonite to Jeroboam the son of Nebat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when all Israel saw that the king did not hearken to them, the people answered the king,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Rehoboam came to Jerusalem, he assembled all the house of Judah, and the tribe of Benjamin, a hundred and eighty thousand chosen warriors, to fight against the house of Israel, to restore the kingdom to Rehoboam the son of Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.1+2CH.11.2+2CH.11.3+2CH.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Chron 11.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But the word of God came to Shemaiah the man of God: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Say to Rehoboam the son of Solomon, king of Judah, and to all the house of Judah and Benjamin, and to the rest of the people, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", You shall not go up or fight against your kinsmen the people of Israel. Return every man to his home, for this thing is from me.’ ” So they hearkened to the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and went home again, according to the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jeroboam built Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and dwelt there; and he went out from there and built Penuel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jeroboam said in his heart, “Now the kingdom will turn back to the house of David; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if this people go up to offer sacrifices in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " at Jerusalem, then the heart of this people will turn again to their lord, to Rehoboam king of Judah, and they will kill me and return to Rehoboam king of Judah.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the king took counsel, and made two calves of gold. And he said to the people, “You have gone up to Jerusalem long enough. Behold your gods, O Israel, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he set one in Bethel, and the other he put in Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this thing became a sin, for the people went to the one at Bethel and to the other as far as Dan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12.30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "went to the one as far as Dan",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also made houses on high places, and appointed priests from among all the people, who were not of the Levites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jeroboam appointed a feast on the fifteenth day of the eighth month like the feast that was in Judah, and he offered sacrifices upon the altar; so he did in Bethel, sacrificing to the calves that he made. And he placed in Bethel the priests of the high places that he had made. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He went up to the altar which he had made in Bethel on the fifteenth day in the eighth month, in the month which he had devised of his own heart; and he ordained a feast for the people of Israel, and went up to the altar to burn incense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
